Citation Style Language styles and locale

Styles (https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles):
  apa.csl                          APA Style 7th edition
  chicago-author-date.csl          Chicago Manual of Style 18th edition (author-date)
  chicago-notes-bibliography.csl   Chicago Manual of Style 18th edition (notes and bibliography)
  modern-language-association.csl  MLA Handbook 9th edition
  harvard-cite-them-right.csl      Cite Them Right 12th edition (Harvard)
  ieee.csl                         IEEE Reference Guide
  nlm-citation-sequence.csl        NLM/Vancouver: Citing Medicine 2nd edition

Locale (https://github.com/citation-style-language/locales):
  locales-en-US.xml                English (US)

These files are by the Citation Style Language project and their
contributors (the authors and contributors are named in each file's
<info> element). They are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

PRKS ships them unmodified. The exact upstream commits and file hashes
are recorded in VERSION next to this file.
